    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Saying where you live",
     "texto": [
      "**Je** before a vowel or a silent h becomes **j'**: **j'habite** (I live).",
      "With cities you use **à**: **J'habite à Paris**. With feminine countries, **en**: **en France**, **en Espagne**.",
      "After «parler», the language has no article: **Je parle français**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
